OL,3,CFormer Neo-Nazi to stand for
OL,4,CConservatives
OL,6,FA former neo-Nazi will be standing for
OL,7,Fthe Conservative Party at next year's
OL,8,Flocal elections in Somerset.
OL,10,FSomerset residents will go to the
OL,11,Fpolls on May 6 to elect 96 councillors
OL,12,Fto serve on Somerset Council for the
OL,13,Fnext four years ` with this being the
OL,14,Ffirst election to be held under the
OL,15,Fnew boundaries following a
OL,16,Fconsultation by the Local Government
OL,17,FBoundary Commission for England
OL,18,F(LGBCE).
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/11
