FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786097900
OL,3,CFormer Neo-Nazi to stand for
OL,4,CConservatives
OL,6,FSeveral sitting councillors have
OL,7,Falready indicated their intention to
OL,8,Fstand, with existing council leader
OL,9,FBill Revans contesting a revised North
OL,10,FPetherton seat and Oliver Patrick
OL,11,Fseeking to be re-elected to the
OL,12,Famended Coker division.
OL,14,FThe most recent candidate to declare
OL,15,Fis Joshua Bonehill-Paine, who will be
OL,16,Fstanding for the Tories in the new
OL,17,FCrewkerne South division ` having
OL,18,Fpreviously served three years in
OL,19,Fprison.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786097900
OL,3,CFormer Neo-Nazi to stand for
OL,4,CConservatives
OL,6,FMr Bonehill-Paine has a conviction for
OL,7,Fassaulting a police officer and
OL,8,Fburglary of a police station, and was
OL,9,Fconvicted in 2014 of malicious
OL,10,Fcommunications over an anti-Islam hoax
OL,11,Fthat led to death threats against the
OL,12,Fowners of a pub in Leicester.
OL,14,FHe was jailed in 2015 for more than
OL,15,Fthree years after posting "vile" anti-
OL,16,FSemitic material online ahead of a
OL,17,Fplanned neo-Nazi rally.
OL,26,@wD@[OUwD@`O]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786097900
OL,3,CFormer Neo-Nazi to stand for
OL,4,CConservatives
OL,6,FThe following year, he was convicted
OL,7,Fof racially aggravated harassment
OL,8,Ftowards Jewish then-Labour MP Luciana
OL,9,FBerger, whom he described online as a
OL,10,F"rodent" and a "evil money-grabber".
OL,12,FSince being released from prison in
OL,13,F2018, he has held various counter-
OL,14,Fextremism certifications from the Home
OL,15,FOffice and became an executive member
OL,16,Fof the Conservatives' Yeovil branch,
OL,17,Fworking as an events organiser and
OL,18,Fdescribed its chairman as "a vocal
OL,19,Fadvocate" for his rehabilitation.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@HO]rD@POUrD@cO]zD@[OU{D@IO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
