PN,40905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786097900
OL,3,CFormer Neo-Nazi to stand for
OL,4,CConservatives
OL,6,FMr Bonehill-Paine is also the creator
OL,7,Fof the Crewkerne Gazette, a Facebook
OL,8,Fsite which posts AI-generated
OL,9,Fsatirical political videos.
OL,11,FUnder the boundary changes, the
OL,12,Fexisting Crewkerne division will be
OL,13,Freplaced with two new divisions `
OL,14,FCrewkerne North and Merriott (which
OL,15,Fincludes the Crewkerne Key Site,
OL,16,FWadham School and most of the town
OL,17,Fcentre) and Crewkerne South (which
OL,18,Fincludes the railway station and
OL,19,Fnumerous villages near the Dorset
OL,20,Fborder).
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786097900
OL,3,CFormer Neo-Nazi to stand for
OL,4,CConservatives
OL,6,FAnnouncing his candidacy on his
OL,7,Fofficial Facebook page, Mr Bonehill-
OL,8,FPaine said he was "tremendously proud"
OL,9,Fto be selected and said that the
OL,10,Fruling Liberal Democrats had "let us
OL,11,Fdown very badly" since the last local
OL,12,Felections in 2022.
OL,14,FHe said: "The roads are broken. The
OL,15,Ftraffic is a disaster. The shops are
OL,16,Fempty.
OL,18,F"Houses are being built everywhere,
OL,19,Flocal people are ignored, and our
OL,20,Fbeautiful green spaces are
OL,21,Fdisappearing.
OL,26,@pD@SOUpD@fO]rD@^OUsD@PO]vD@JOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786097900
OL,3,CFormer Neo-Nazi to stand for
OL,4,CConservatives
OL,6,F"Children with SEND? Failed by this
OL,7,Fcouncil. Families are fighting for
OL,8,Fbasic support while the politicians
OL,9,Foffer excuses. It is disgraceful, and
OL,10,Fit must end.
OL,12,F"I will fight for local people first.
OL,13,FMore police, better roads, better
OL,14,Fbuses, better healthcare, real support
OL,15,Ffor SEND children and protection for
OL,16,Four countryside.
OL,18,F"Housing that works for local
OL,19,Ffamilies, not endless development
OL,20,Fimposed on us.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786097900
OL,3,CFormer Neo-Nazi to stand for
OL,4,CConservatives
OL,6,F"No more weakness, no more excuses, no
OL,7,Fmore decline, no more being forgotten.
OL,9,F"We are going to restore our town. We
OL,10,Fare going to bring back pride.
OL,12,F"We are going to win ` and together,
OL,13,Fwe can get Crewkerne, and Somerset,
OL,14,Fworking again."
OL,16,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch MP
OL,17,Fsaid that Mr Bonehill-Paine had "shown
OL,18,Fcontrition for his crimes" and
OL,19,Fdeserved a second chance having served
OL,20,Fout his sentences.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@AOUtD@AOUvD@OO]yD@aOUzD@ZO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786097900
OL,3,CFormer Neo-Nazi to stand for
OL,4,CConservatives
OL,6,FShe told the Huffington Post: "Josh is
OL,7,Fsomeone who actually has been
OL,8,Fcertified by the Home Office to train
OL,9,Fpolice officers on anti-Semitism and
OL,10,Fon countering extremism.
OL,12,F"Yes, he is somebody who had been
OL,13,Fpreviously convicted, but he is
OL,14,Fsomeone has shown contrition for his
OL,15,Fcrimes, has been rehabilitated and is
OL,16,Fspending every day working to solve
OL,17,Fthe very problem which he knew he had
OL,18,Fcaused previously.
OL,26,@nD@_OUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/11
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786097900
OL,3,CFormer Neo-Nazi to stand for
OL,4,CConservatives
OL,6,F"He's going up and down the country
OL,7,Ftraining people and the Conservative
OL,8,FParty believes in second chances.
OL,10,F"This is not just someone that we've
OL,11,Fpicked up who's a convicted criminal,
OL,12,Fthis somebody who is actively working
OL,13,Fto help communities, especially Jewish
OL,14,Fcommunities and this is what I want to
OL,15,Fsee.
OL,17,F"I want second chances for good
OL,18,Fpeople, for people who've their
OL,19,Flessons for people who are showing
OL,20,Fthat they know what they did was
OL,21,Fwrong."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUyD@AOU}D@GO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/11
