OL,3,CFormer Neo-Nazi to stand for
OL,4,CConservatives
OL,6,FThe local elections will be held in
OL,7,FSomerset on May 6, 2027, with the full
OL,8,Flist of candidates expected to be
OL,9,Fpublished by early-April 2027.
OL,11,FITV News has reached out to Mr
OL,12,FBonehill-Paine and the Conservative
OL,13,FParty for comment.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/11
